    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξῠ-τονέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pronounce with an acute accent,</i> i. e. on the last
